@startuml
title ЛР16. Локальна збірка та CI через GitHub Actions

skinparam shadowing false

actor Developer

box "Local machine"
    participant "IntelliJ IDEA" as IDE
    participant "Maven" as Maven
    participant "javac -h" as Javac
    participant "clang++" as Clang
    participant "Java tests" as Tests
end box

box "Repository"
    participant "GitHub" as GitHub
end box

box "GitHub Actions"
    participant "CI workflow\nci.yml" as CI
    participant "Ubuntu runner" as Runner
end box

Developer -> IDE : edit Java and C++ code
IDE -> Maven : mvn compile
Maven --> IDE : Java build result

IDE -> Javac : generate JNI header
Javac --> IDE : native-headers/*.h

IDE -> Clang : build native library
Clang --> IDE : nativenormalizer.dll / libnativenormalizer.so

IDE -> Tests : mvn test
Tests --> IDE : test result

Developer -> GitHub : git push / pull request

GitHub -> CI : start workflow

CI -> Runner : checkout repository
CI -> Runner : set up JDK 21
CI -> Runner : generate JNI headers
CI -> Runner : build native library with clang++
CI -> Runner : mvn compile
CI -> Runner : mvn test

Runner --> CI : success / failure
CI --> GitHub : workflow status
GitHub --> Developer : CI result

@enduml